# Personal Configuration — gitignored
#
# Copy this file to `starflow.user.yaml` (drop the `.example` suffix) and
# customize. The real file is gitignored so your personal tweaks never
# enter git. Overrides everything below it in precedence:
#   1. config/starflow.yaml              (base, this repo)
#   2. config/custom/starflow.yaml       (team, committed)
#   3. config/custom/starflow.user.yaml  (you, gitignored)  ← this file
#
